    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.map\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nCurrently, it seems there are only three highlights available: `MiniMapSymbolLine`, `MiniMapSymbolView` and `MiniMapSymbolCount` - none of which adjust the highlight of the visualized text in the map. Could we get a way to adjust this?",
